Downloaded from http://folk.uio.no/knutf/bases/four/ at 5-6-2003

(Updated 2001.03.03.)

This directory contains Gaussian basis sets for 4-component relativistic 
molecular calculations. 

For the moment this consists of a series of dual family sets covering the 
range K - (118). These are collected in 6 files starting with TCA.2001.
The basis sets are described in the article

        Knut Faegri: Relativistic Gaussian basis sets for 
                     the elements K - Uuo. 
	             TCA, 105, 252 - 258, 2001.

I also have a variety of other basis sets for this type of calculations.
I have not yet systematized these for presentation. However, if you
have any special interests, please contact me.

